        "raw": "<p>Greetings One &amp; All,</p><p>For the past few months I have been posting regualr boardgame reviews on YouTube (youtube.com/dloboardgames).</p><p>I have kept it no secret that I am a massive fan of all things Sentinels. As such, as the first season comes to a finish, I want to end on something big--nay, massive!</p><p>Next week will be the first D-Lo Games: Sentinels Week! Each day we will release a video about Sentinels of the Multiverse. I&#39;ll be finishing a series of videos discussing each villain at length and finally posting our review of Sentinels of the Mulitiverse. However, that is only 4 videos and I need 5.</p><p>So, the final video will be a fan video celebrating favorite heroes. And, I need your help.&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone who wishes to participate may create a video explaining who their favorite hero is and why. Try to keep the video as close as 30 seconds as possible. PM if you wish to participate and I will give you my e-mail address and more info.</p><p>I wanted to have a final video in which we review Wrath of the Cosmos. However, I moved and didn&#39;t receive the address change e-mail others mentioned regarding my pre-order. Is that because they haven&#39;t sent it out yet?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>TL;DR:&nbsp;Guy who makes mistake riddled SotM videos is making a fan video. You can help by sending him a PM and creating a 30 second video about your favorite hero. Also, how do we change our address for WotC preorders? (Oh yeah, I&#39;m that bag of mistakes wearing a man suit that makes those SotM videos)</strong></h4>",
